    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a dual-edged sword for me—both a source of deep fascination and frustration. I appreciate its logical structure and how it can solve real-world problems, especially in baking or gardening where measurements matter. However, my education was limited, and I often feel like I'm playing catch-up, even though I enjoy the challenge.",
