    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I’ve experimented with AI tools like Khan Academy’s app and even some interactive platforms that break down problems step by step. It’s been a mixed bag—some explanations click instantly, while others leave me more confused than before. I prefer when AI adapts to my level rather than assuming prior knowledge.",
